  "release_notes": "SKU IPC-S2VBP-5M0WR is shared with the non-Pro 'Rex VT'; distributors that title this SKU 'Rex VT Pro' (orbitadigital, visiotech, eurotechnology) add a 2.4\" display. Night-vision range is stated as 20m in Imou feature copy and 30m in some distributor spec tables — recorded the more conservative 20m. Some distributor templates also list Ethernet RJ45 and -30~+50 C operating temp; both look like generic-template artifacts for this WiFi-only DC-plug indoor camera and were omitted pending official confirmation.",
